      "date": "2025-01-01",
      "kind": "original",
      "authority_verified": true,
      "text": "SYNTHETIC FIXTURE — invented solely for testing; no real issuer.\nSection 1. Eligibility\nBidders must be registered to conduct business in Example State.\nSection 2. Submission deadline\nProposals must be submitted by 2025-02-01 at 17:00 UTC.\nSection 3. Response contents\nProposals must include a fixed-price budget.\nIf subcontractors are used, proposals must include each subcontractor's role.\nSection 4. Submission channel\nBidders must submit proposals through the procurement portal.\nSection 5. Preferences\nTeams should describe their approach to accessibility testing.\nSection 6. Rejection\nLate proposals will be rejected and shall receive no evaluation.\nSection 7. Other delivery rule\nDelivery of an editable project schedule is a condition of acceptance.\n",
      "sha256": "7491cb902b0dbd55bcd8827c22a960322923bf44b088c29d537e2f6999c0a2a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "path": "amendment.txt",
      "version": "1",
      "date": "2025-01-03",
      "kind": "amendment",
      "authority_verified": true,
      "text": "SYNTHETIC FIXTURE — amendment authority is a simulated test attribute.\nSection 2. Submission deadline (replaces RFP section 2)\nProposals must be submitted by 2025-02-05 at 17:00 UTC.\nSection 8. Amendment acknowledgment\nBidders must acknowledge amendment A1 in their response.\n",
      "sha256": "e44c85b38b01d698418aa1b5f28ded62e1bff594bd4aa1f17e76f8bcac0738f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "QA",
