      "authority_verified": false,
      "text": "SYNTHETIC FIXTURE — deliberate unresolved Q&A conflict.\nSection 4. Submission channel\nBidders must submit proposals by email.\nSection 9. Reference format\nBidders may attach screenshots as optional examples.\n",
